@startuml
title Sequence Diagram Pendaftaran Akun Tata Usaha (Super Admin)

actor "Super Admin" as SA
boundary "UI" as UI
control "Controller" as C
entity "Database" as DB

== Akses Form Pendaftaran ==
SA -> UI: 1. Akses menu "Buat Akun Tata Usaha"
UI -> C: 2. Request form pendaftaran
C --> UI: 3. Load registration form
UI --> SA: 4. Tampilkan form pendaftaran

== Submit Pendaftaran ==
SA -> UI: 5. Input data (nama, email, password) + submit
UI -> C: 6. Handle form submission
C -> C: 7. Validate form data

alt Data valid
    C -> DB: 7.1. Check email availability
    
    alt Email tersedia
        DB --> C: 7.2. Email available
        C -> DB: 7.3. Create Tata Usaha account
        DB --> C: 7.4. Account created successfully
        C -> DB: 7.5. Get updated accounts list
        DB --> C: 7.6. Return updated data
        C --> UI: 7.7. Success response + refresh data
        UI --> SA: 7.8. "Berhasil membuat akun" + update tabel
    else Email sudah digunakan
        DB --> C: 7.2. Email already exists
        C --> UI: 7.3. Error response
        UI --> SA: 7.4. "Email sudah digunakan"
    end
    
else Data tidak valid
    C --> UI: 7.1. Validation error
    UI --> SA: 7.2. Tampilkan pesan error:
    note right
    - "Wajib mengisi semua formulir"
    - "Wajib mengisi email" 
    - "Kata sandi minimal 6 karakter"
    end note
end

@enduml